WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.708
This query rewrites the admission-count problem The
inner query groups

00:00:05.722 --> 00:00:11.417
admissions once by patient ID The outer query joins
those counts

00:00:11.443 --> 00:00:17.049
to patients Run it and compare the result with the
correlated scalar

00:00:17.075 --> 00:00:22.753
version The business meaning and patient-level grain
should remain the same

00:00:24.499 --> 00:00:28.012
When rewriting always verify that the result did not
change
